  <h1>About {{ business.name }}</h1>
  <p>
    {{ business.name }} started as a longbox in a garage and a shelf of childhood
    toys that never quite made it to the yard sale. Now it's a storefront on
    Vinyl Row — back issues sorted by condition, vintage toys tested before they're
    listed, and a soft spot for anything a previous owner clearly loved.
  </p>
  <p>
    Everything in the shop is graded honestly. "Near Mint" means near mint, "Loose"
    means exactly that, and if something's got a flaw worth knowing about, it's in
    the description — not a surprise when it arrives.
  </p>
